DSP / adaptation
----------------
The existing DT303-derived DSP and ACID-XY adaptation notice is retained:
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

Original reference: DT303 by srtuss, 2022-12-04
https://dittytoy.net/ditty/0029103012
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

This package contains a fixed-point C++ adaptation and subsequent modifications
for the Open-XY callback interface, controls, filtering, envelope handling,
overdrive, distortion, output protection and FAST CPU optimizations. Retain
the attribution, link the license, and identify your changes. No endorsement
by the original author is implied. No ownership of third-party work or right
to relicense it under MIT is asserted by this package.

